cff-version: 1.2.0
message: if you use windfold, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "windfold: wind-farm wake interactions learned from SCADA"
abstract: >-
  a Gaussian model of each turbine's power relative to its peers that combines calibrated PyWake
  physics driven by measured turbulence with per-turbine offsets and one learned correction shared
  by all turbine pairs in wind-aligned coordinates, with a benchmark of 23 models on four open SCADA
  datasets scored on wind-direction sectors held out from training.
